  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_3218.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Font de Dins de Onda ha acogido este s&aacute;bado la fiesta de bienvenida al verano, con m&uacute;sica de los 80, 90 y 2000, con los dj&#39;s Josvi y&nbsp;Juaki (en la foto), y tambi&eacute;n Don Vito Corleone (Il Ratto) y DJ Campos. El evento ha sido organizado por Les Tasques, L&#39;entrep&agrave; y Desiguala2.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3136.jpg\" alt=\"img_3136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3218.jpg\" alt=\"img_3218\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3219.jpg\" alt=\"img_3219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3220.jpg\" alt=\"img_3220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3221.jpg\" alt=\"img_3221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3222.jpg\" alt=\"img_3222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3223.jpg\" alt=\"img_3223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3224.jpg\" alt=\"img_3224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3225.jpg\" alt=\"img_3225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djsfontdedins/img_3226.